 summary report for the mayor of Melody Metropolis, and you=E2=80=99ve just=
 completed the lesson on statistical thinking! We covered a lot of informat=
ion, including:</p>
<ul class=3D"g-md-ul">
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Summary <div class=3D"gamut-lliey7-Box ebnwbv90"><div=
 class=3D"gamut-ud7xvi-Box-TargetContainer eh9y8s82"><a href=3D"https://www=
.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/resources/docs/general/statistics" target=3D"_blank" aria-d=
