Docs Loading link description</div></span></div></div> give us measurements=
 to describe our data.</li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Categorical <div class=3D"gamut-lliey7-Box ebnwbv90">=
<div class=3D"gamut-ud7xvi-Box-TargetContainer eh9y8s82"><a href=3D"https:/=
/www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/resources/docs/general/julia/variables" target=3D"_blan=
